{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "损失往哪走",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 90.56,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "六大类里，钱到底丢在哪儿？我们看损失的变化。",
   "spoken": "六大类里，钱到底丢在哪儿？我们看损失的变化。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 1.693,
   "speechEnd": 5.465
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "先说口径。下面的数字来自公开报道和安全公司的年度统计，按事发时的美元估值，都是约数。",
   "spoken": "先说口径。下面的数字来自公开报道和安全公司的年度统计，按事发时的美元估值，都是约数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.9,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 5.992,
   "speechEnd": 13.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "2016 年，The DAO 因为重入，损失约 6000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2016 年，The-DAO 因为虫入，损失约 6000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 14.36,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 14.36,
   "speechEnd": 18.661
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "那几年多是重入、溢出这类代码漏洞。编译器和库成熟以后，这类漏洞少了。",
   "spoken": "那几年多是虫入、溢出这类代码漏洞。编译器和库成熟以后，这类漏洞少了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 19.06,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 19.06,
   "speechEnd": 25.827
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "2022 年，Ronin 跨链桥损失约 6.2 亿美元，原因是验证者私钥。",
   "spoken": "2022 年，Ronin 跨链桥损失约 6.2 亿美元，原因是验证者私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 26.24,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 26.342,
   "speechEnd": 32.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "2024 年，DMM Bitcoin 损失约 3.05 亿美元。入口是假招聘，落点是供应商的终端。",
   "spoken": "2024 年，DMM-Bitcoin 损失约 3.05 亿美元。入口是假招聘，落点是供应商的终端。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 33.26,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 33.363,
   "speechEnd": 41.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "2025 年，就是开头的 Bybit，约 15 亿美元，出在前端和签名界面。",
   "spoken": "2025 年，就是开头的 Bybit，约 15 亿美元，出在前端和签名界面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 42.36,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 42.466,
   "speechEnd": 48.692
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 热钱包损失约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 热钱包损失约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 49.14,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 49.241,
   "speechEnd": 55.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "按这个口径，它超过此前任何单起事故的 4 倍。",
   "spoken": "按这个口径，它超过此前任何单起事故的 4 倍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 56.0,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 56.098,
   "speechEnd": 60.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "趋势很清楚。最大的损失，从代码漏洞，转向了跨链桥和运营安全。",
   "spoken": "趋势很清楚。最大的损失，从代码漏洞，转向了跨链桥和运营安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 60.78,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 60.78,
   "speechEnd": 66.981
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "私钥、多签、前端、社工、内部人。代码审计，覆盖不到这些环节。",
   "spoken": "私钥、多签、前端、社工、内部人。代码审计，覆盖不到这些环节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 67.4,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "speechStart": 67.4,
   "speechEnd": 73.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "但数学类漏洞并没有消失。2025 年的 Balancer V2，在舍入方向上出了错。",
   "spoken": "但数学类漏洞并没有消失。2025 年的 Balancer-V2，在舍入方向上出了错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 74.02,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 74.02,
   "speechEnd": 80.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "项目方口径约 9480 万美元，早期报道约 1.28 亿。成熟的协议，也会在这里出错。",
   "spoken": "项目方口径约 9480 万美元，早期报道约 1.28 亿。成熟的协议，也会在这里出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
